From 5caae06dcfe57ae6a497397de98b91f406ee3c64 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:49:47 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 03/31] kcm_workspace: Form page ordered by use, plain
 FormLayout instead of Kirigami.Form

Page type: Form (docs/page-design.md). Config keys, kcfg files, D-Bus signals and behaviour are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- First section (no title) is now "how do clicks work": click files or folders (kcm_workspace/singleClick), double-click
  interval with the test folder (doubleClickInterval), middle-click paste (primarySelection, Wayland only).
  Before, the page opened with Plasma tooltips/OSD.
- Then Scrolling, Text Cursor, Drag and Drop, "Tablet Mode" (was "Touch"; tabletMode) and "Tooltips and Popups"
  (was "Plasma"; delay, osdEnabled) as the rare ones at the bottom.
- "Allow Plasma to show: Panel and widget tooltips / OSD popups for status changes" -> checkboxes "Show panel and widget
  tooltips" and "Show OSD popups for status changes" (kcm_workspace/delay, osdEnabled).
- New "Keyboard Layout Popup..." button opens kcm_keyboard, which owns OSD/kbdLayoutChangedEnabled
  (ia/duplicates.md); kcm_workspace keeps only the master OSD switch (kcm_workspace/osdKbdLayoutChangedEnabled).
- Radio hints are small labels under the radio instead of FormEntry subtitles; the restart message is unchanged
  (kcm_workspace/RestartPrimarySelection).
- Relabel table: inventory/relabel/kcm_workspace.tsv (outer repo). 12 inventory rows kept, 0 lost (--strict).

Speed:
- Nothing in the KCM blocks: workspaceoptions.cpp only builds three KCoreConfigSkeleton objects (kdeglobals, kwinrc,
  plasmarc) in the constructor; save() only emits D-Bus signals. The cost is the QML tree.
- Kirigami.Form/FormGroup/FormEntry build a title/subtitle/trailing-items layout for each of ~25 rows; replaced by
  Kirigami.FormLayout rows with at most one RowLayout each. Estimate from code only, not measured.
- Numbers: before (build/bench/clean/before-*.tsv, measured under load). After: pending, manager will measure.

HIG: HIG-001, HIG-005, HIG-006, HIG-013, HIG-017, HIG-019, HIG-020, HIG-047, HIG-058.

Not built yet (freeze).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
